> Odd to have {le} but not {lo}

Yes, but I'm looking for an absolutely minimal base, variations on a theme can 
be introduced later.

> The numbers are a usual early lesson

... and would count as cmavo.  Would you like to add, say, "ze : 7" to the 
list?

> Hello, Goodbye, Please, Thank you, You're welcome, Excuse me
> (etc)

I would expect people to add these over the next few days.  In part I'm 
interested to see what people think are the essentials, as well as getting 
the list itself.

I think that in a series of lessons, each lesson should contain a few variants 
of earlier vocab as well as new vocab.  Grow up as well as out in every 
lesson.  Later lessons should add the rafsi of gismu encountered earlier.  
That's how I'm building the lists for my vocab drill program.

Thanks for your input, your thoughts are welcome.


